ng 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-b4beac077521d693END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-5c61e42c9996b055END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_BOOK_LOW_BasiliskGate_StoneLordReports</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_BasiliskGate_StoneLordReports\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_BOOK_LOW_BasiliskGate_StoneLordReports\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">706852f5-576a-4c50-a475-03e7ec5e5dbc</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:706852f5-576a-4c50-a475-03e7ec5e5dbc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:706852f5-576a-4c50-a475-03e7ec5e5dbc\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a desk in <a href=\"/wiki/Heapside_Prison\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Heapside Prison\">Heapside Prison</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-1281&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;776</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[A detailed report on the rise of the Stone Lord.]\n</p><p>... judging by the targeting of known Guild enterprises and the murder of prolific Guild members, it is my professional conclusion that a new player has gained a foothold of the city's underbelly: the <a href=\"/wiki/Minsc\" title=\"Minsc\">Stone Lord</a>.\n</p><p><br>\nMy sources suggest that <a href=\"/wiki/Nine-Fingers_Keene\" title=\"Nine-Fingers Keene\">Ninefingers</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/The_Guild\" title=\"The Guild\">the Guild</a> still hold power, but the Stone Lord is pressing aggressively on her territory. This is not a case of a petty turf war - this is a fight for the throne in the city's underworld, one that could easily spill out onto the city if ignored.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714203000\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1358/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25831/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7329/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 931256/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   43.098      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   43.098      1 -total\n 49.55%   21.355      6 Template:Icon_text\n 43.73%   18.846     15 Template:Trim\n 22.56%    9.724      2 Template:Uid\n 16.08%    6.930      1 Template:Main_only\n 13.17%    5.675      2 Template:Template_style\n 12.37%    5.333      1 Template:Books\n 11.76%    5.070      1 Template:Icon_link\n 10.92%    4.707      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser 